SCOPE

This license covers the TOOLS and DOCUMENTATION in this repository, and the
English translation text in work/translation/ and work/glossary/.

It does NOT and cannot cover Mouri Motonari: Chikai no Sanshi itself. The game,
its script, its data and its assets remain the property of their owner (Koei
Tecmo). This repository contains none of them, and you need your own copy of the
game for any of it to be useful.

The GenEi Late Gothic font in tools/fonts/genei-latin/ keeps its own license
(SIL Open Font License, tools/fonts/genei-latin/LICENSE.txt).

The translation is a derivative work of the game made by fans, distributed in
the hope that it is useful, with no claim on the underlying work.
